<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-10-13T21:44:59+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:44:59 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Tiny Scottish island of Lismore uncovers evidence of a medieval Christian monastery]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134921819.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Residents of Lismore, a tiny Scottish island with around 190 inhabitants, raised funds for archaeological excavations that uncovered a medieval cemetery, ancient buildings and more than 1,000 metalworking artefacts. The discoveries suggest the island was an important religious and craft centre during the sixth and seventh centuries, shedding new light on early Christianity in northern Britain.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/tiny-scottish-island-of-lismore-home-to-190-residents-uncovers-fresh-evidence-of-a-legendary-christian-monastery-experts-uncover-medieval-cemetery-and-over-1000-artefacts/articleshow/134921819.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/tiny-scottish-island-of-lismore-home-to-190-residents-uncovers-fresh-evidence-of-a-legendary-christian-monastery-experts-uncover-medieval-cemetery-and-over-1000-artefacts/articleshow/134921819.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T21:31:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921867,imgsize-208697.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Argentina moves to stop Falklands' first commercial oil project, escalating row with UK]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134921107.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/argentina-moves-to-stop-first-commercial-oil-project-on-disputed-falkland-islands-escalating-row-with-uk/articleshow/134921107.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/argentina-moves-to-stop-first-commercial-oil-project-on-disputed-falkland-islands-escalating-row-with-uk/articleshow/134921107.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T21:24:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921667,imgsize-275128.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[$2.8M in public funding protects a 58-acre Utah ranch from development while cattle continue grazing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134921161.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Secured through public funding, a 58-acre ranch in Heber Valley, Utah, is preserved to avert urban sprawl. The Flying A Ranch Preserve will remain dedicated to agriculture, supporting cattle grazing and hay production. The conservation project, supported by nearly $2.8 million in various funding, is crucial for preserving local wildlife habitats and protecting vital water recharge systems, while aiming to safeguard additional farmland in the vicinity.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/after-roughly-2-8-million-in-federal-county-and-state-funding-backed-a-conservation-easement-a-58-acre-utah-ranch-where-70-cattle-still-graze-was-permanently-protected-from-development-while-remaining-working-land/articleshow/134921161.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/after-roughly-2-8-million-in-federal-county-and-state-funding-backed-a-conservation-easement-a-58-acre-utah-ranch-where-70-cattle-still-graze-was-permanently-protected-from-development-while-remaining-working-land/articleshow/134921161.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T21:30:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921896,imgsize-1138609.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists find 170-million-year-old crocodile relative with needle-thin teeth]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134919851.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/scientists-studying-170-million-year-old-fossils-from-morocco-spotted-tiny-black-circles-under-a-microscope-scraping-revealed-needle-thin-teeth-from-a-new-crocodile-relative-that-likely-ate-shrimp-and-small-fish/articleshow/134919851.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/archaeology/scientists-studying-170-million-year-old-fossils-from-morocco-spotted-tiny-black-circles-under-a-microscope-scraping-revealed-needle-thin-teeth-from-a-new-crocodile-relative-that-likely-ate-shrimp-and-small-fish/articleshow/134919851.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T21:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134919885,imgsize-1064366.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Maine bridge partially collapses during concrete pour; crews begin dismantling damaged spans]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134920026.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Following a tragic collapse on August 13, demolition teams are onsite dismantling the damaged portions of the Llewellyn Estes Bridge, which was under construction over the Stillwater River in Old Town. Several workers sustained injuries during the incident and received urgent medical care. Authorities are launching a comprehensive investigation to uncover the precise reasons behind the failure while prioritizing safety in the preparation for future bridge construction.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/maine-was-replacing-an-aging-river-bridge-when-part-of-the-new-structure-collapsed-during-a-concrete-pour-and-injured-workers-two-months-later-crews-are-dismantling-the-damaged-spans-before-construction-resumes/articleshow/134920026.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/maine-was-replacing-an-aging-river-bridge-when-part-of-the-new-structure-collapsed-during-a-concrete-pour-and-injured-workers-two-months-later-crews-are-dismantling-the-damaged-spans-before-construction-resumes/articleshow/134920026.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T20:34:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921132,imgsize-1074661.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Tony Robbins turned a childhood memory of his struggling family receiving groceries from a stranger into Feeding America’s 100 Million Meals Challenge; reached 1 billion meals in 2023]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134914887.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Inspired by his childhood experience with food assistance during Thanksgiving, Tony Robbins has made hunger relief a central cause. Partnering with Feeding America, he initiated the 100 Million Meals Challenge in 2014, ultimately aiming for a billion meals. This ambitious goal was met in 2023, leading to a new target to provide another billion meals by 2035, reflecting Robbins' commitment to combating food insecurity in the U.S.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2014-tony-robbins-turned-a-childhood-memory-of-his-struggling-family-receiving-groceries-from-a-stranger-into-feeding-americas-100-million-meals-challenge-expanded-later-it-reached-1-billion-meals-in-2023/articleshow/134914887.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2014-tony-robbins-turned-a-childhood-memory-of-his-struggling-family-receiving-groceries-from-a-stranger-into-feeding-americas-100-million-meals-challenge-expanded-later-it-reached-1-billion-meals-in-2023/articleshow/134914887.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T21:05:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134914997,imgsize-426180.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['His blood splattered over everybody': US man dies after falling from roller coaster ride]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134921236.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/his-blood-splattered-over-everybody-us-man-dies-after-falling-from-roller-coaster-ride/articleshow/134921236.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/his-blood-splattered-over-everybody-us-man-dies-after-falling-from-roller-coaster-ride/articleshow/134921236.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T21:00:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134921295,imgsize-65853.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Shakira and Roger Waters’ 650-acre Bahamas island listed for $30 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134912946.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/shakira-and-pink-floyds-roger-waters-once-planned-to-transform-a-650-acre-bahamas-island-with-boutique-hotels-luxury-residences-and-an-artists-retreat-it-is-now-listed-for-30-million/articleshow/134912946.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/shakira-and-pink-floyds-roger-waters-once-planned-to-transform-a-650-acre-bahamas-island-with-boutique-hotels-luxury-residences-and-an-artists-retreat-it-is-now-listed-for-30-million/articleshow/134912946.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T20:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134913747,imgsize-2428423.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Claude Lalanne’s bronze monkey armchair with ostrich leather seat sold for $1.079 million]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134911959.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Sotheby’s auction in December 2025 saw the sale of a remarkable gilt-bronze armchair by Claude Lalanne, which captured attention with its elaborate vines and monkey embellishments. This particular design, created in 1998, was the pioneer among Lalanne’s 'Singerie' armchairs to attract a successful sale. The high demand for Lalanne's artistry played a crucial role in achieving an impressive sale price through the auction house's consignment system.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/claude-lalannes-bronze-armchair-with-monkeys-vines-and-an-ostrich-leather-seat-sold-for-1-079-million-after-reaching-sothebys-through-its-online-consignment-portal/articleshow/134911959.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/claude-lalannes-bronze-armchair-with-monkeys-vines-and-an-ostrich-leather-seat-sold-for-1-079-million-after-reaching-sothebys-through-its-online-consignment-portal/articleshow/134911959.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T20:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134912380,imgsize-91827.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[18-year-old's plastic-to-water system earns her a $100,000 scholarship]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134914619.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/meet-elizabeth-hanechak-the-18-year-old-massachusetts-student-whose-microbial-system-could-convert-plastic-waste-into-drinking-water-and-fertiliser-earning-a-100000-scholarship/articleshow/134914619.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/meet-elizabeth-hanechak-the-18-year-old-massachusetts-student-whose-microbial-system-could-convert-plastic-waste-into-drinking-water-and-fertiliser-earning-a-100000-scholarship/articleshow/134914619.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T18:30:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134915151,imgsize-1005646.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[17-year-old Anika Puri builds $300 AI tool to detect poachers with 90% accuracy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134919393.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/meet-anika-puri-the-17-year-old-indian-american-student-who-built-a-300-ai-system-to-spot-elephant-poachers-with-over-90-accuracy-and-won-a-25000-davidson-scholarship-award/articleshow/134919393.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/meet-anika-puri-the-17-year-old-indian-american-student-who-built-a-300-ai-system-to-spot-elephant-poachers-with-over-90-accuracy-and-won-a-25000-davidson-scholarship-award/articleshow/134919393.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T20:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134919411,imgsize-604451.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Fake GoFundMe story about veteran's $20 gas gift raises $400,000 from 14,000 donors]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134918536.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Katelyn McClure and Mark D'Amico launched a heartfelt campaign to support Johnny Bobbitt Jr, a homeless veteran, asserting that he heroically assisted McClure during a fuel mishap. This poignant story garnered around $400,000 from over 14,000 donors, who were unaware of the deception. Upon investigation, it was revealed that the couple misappropriated the contributions for lavish purchases while Bobbitt pursued legal recourse for his funds.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-new-jersey-couples-story-about-a-homeless-veteran-spending-his-last-20-on-gas-raised-about-400000-from-more-than-14000-donors-investigators-later-found-the-viral-gofundme-story-was-fabricated/articleshow/134918536.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-new-jersey-couples-story-about-a-homeless-veteran-spending-his-last-20-on-gas-raised-about-400000-from-more-than-14000-donors-investigators-later-found-the-viral-gofundme-story-was-fabricated/articleshow/134918536.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T19:03:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134919490,imgsize-1160786.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump administration asks Don Jr's ex-girlfriend Kimberly Guilfoyle to resign as US ambassador to Greece amid several complaints]]></title><description><![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-administration-asks-don-jrs-ex-girlfriend-kimberly-guilfoyle-to-resign-as-us-ambassador-to-greece-amid-several-complaints/articleshow/134920088.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-administration-asks-don-jrs-ex-girlfriend-kimberly-guilfoyle-to-resign-as-us-ambassador-to-greece-amid-several-complaints/articleshow/134920088.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T19:41:48+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134920226,imgsize-78144.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iran seeking to expand attacks in UK to military sites, MI5 chief warns]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134919421.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Iran is reportedly increasing its focus on military targets in Britain, including RAF Fairford. The suspected plot against the air base has prompted significant security responses and investigations. British authorities believe the incident may have links to Iran's Revolutionary Guard. Additionally, MI5 chief Ken McCallum highlighted broader trends in Iran's threat activities this year. The rise of state threats and the potential misuse of artificial intelligence were also addressed.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/not-unique-iran-seeking-to-expand-attacks-in-uk-to-military-sites-mi5-chief-warns-after-raf-fairford-incident/articleshow/134919421.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/not-unique-iran-seeking-to-expand-attacks-in-uk-to-military-sites-mi5-chief-warns-after-raf-fairford-incident/articleshow/134919421.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-13T19:23:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134919830,imgsize-120492.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ken Paxton partied in Dubai with two US fugitives, one had donated $190,000: Bombshell report amid Texas Senate race]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134919243.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ken-paxton-partied-in-dubai-with-two-us-fugitives-one-had-donated-190000-bombshell-report-amid-texas-senate-race/articleshow/134919243.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ken-paxton-partied-in-dubai-with-two-us-fug